---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
transKey: plan-catalog
pageCss:
  - planes-hub.css
  - plan-page.css
title: "Training Plans — Filter by Sport, Distance and Level | Triaperformance"
description: "Every Triaperformance training plan on TrainingPeaks: running, cycling, swimming, triathlon, duathlon and HYROX. Filter by sport, distance, level and duration."
---
{%- set catalogPlans = plans.byLanguage.en -%}
{%- set u = planUi.en -%}
<section class="plan-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">Training Plans</span>
    <h1>Every plan, filtered by what you're after</h1>
    <p class="section-intro">{{ catalogPlans.length }} plans on TrainingPeaks — running, cycling, swimming, triathlon, duathlon and HYROX. Filter by sport, distance, level and duration.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="sport-tiles" aria-label="{{ u.filterSport }}">
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/en/plans/running/"><b>{{ u.sport["Running"] or "Running" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Running") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/en/plans/cycling/"><b>{{ u.sport["Cycling"] or "Cycling" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Cycling") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/en/plans/swimming/"><b>{{ u.sport["Swimming"] or "Swimming" }}</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("sport", "Swimming") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/en/plans/ironman/"><b>Ironman</b><span>{{ (catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "Half")) + (catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "Full")) }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
      <a class="sport-tile" href="/en/plans/weight-loss/"><b>Weight Loss</b><span>{{ catalogPlans | facetCount("distance", "Weight Loss") }} {{ u.resultsCount }}</span></a>
    </nav>
    <div class="planes-aa">
      <p>Racing more than one goal this year? Don't buy them one at a time. The whole catalogue for <b>${{ allAccess.en.price }}/mo</b>.</p>
      <a href="/en/all-access/">See All-Access</a>
    </div>
    <div class="catalog-recommended-head">
      <h2>{{ u.recommendedLabel }}</h2>
      <p>{{ u.recommendedIntro }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/plan-catalog-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/coaching-cta.njk" %}
